{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36433","headline":"鸳鸯 · 罗邺","name":"鸳鸯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红闲碧霁瑞烟开，锦翅双飞去又回。\n一种鸟怜名字好，尽缘人恨别离来。\n暖依牛渚汀莎媚，夕宿龙池禁漏催。\n相对若教春女见，便须携向凤凰台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36433.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36433","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}